  <itemEum id="hero.gen.npc2" name="Legendary Ring" itemType="宝物" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="An ancient ring status unknown.It seems to be a ring wear by ancient heroes." itemDesc="An ancient ring status unknown.It seems to be a ring wear by ancient heroes." iconUrl="images/icon/shop/legendary_ring.png" price="100"/>
  <itemEum id="hero.intelligence.1" name="The Art of War" itemType="宝物" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="Increase a hero's intelligence by 25% when rewarded. Effective for 7 days." itemDesc="The Art of War, written by Chinese military strategist Sun Tzu, is widely read around the world. Being translated into different languages, it is a textbook of many military academies in this planet." iconUrl="images/items/suenzibingfa.png" price="40" heroItem="true"/>
  <itemEum id="hero.item.Essential_Oil" name="Essential Oil" itemType="宝物" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="Recuperates hero's Strength by 100%." itemDesc="Various essential oils have been used medicinally at different periods in history. Medical application proposed by those who sell medicinal oils range from skin treatments to remedies for cancer, and are often based on historical use of these oils for these purposes." iconUrl="images/items/20090630/Essential Oil.png" price="100" heroItem="true"/>
  <itemEum id="hero.item.Lugui_Wine" name="Lugui Wine" itemType="宝物" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="Recuperates hero's Strength by 30%." itemDesc="It’s said that emperors of ancient China were seeking methods to grant them immortality. They ordered their alchemists to work on this amrita. Those alchemists boiled, stewed and fried the turtle shells together with buckhorns, and then put them into the wine to infuse for a long time, thus the Lugui wine whose pronunciation was derived from Chinese articulation was done." iconUrl="images/items/20090630/Lugui Wine.png" price="30" heroItem="true"/>
  <itemEum id="hero.item.Panax_ginseng" name="Panax ginseng" itemType="宝物" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="Recuperates hero's Strength by 60%." itemDesc="American and Panax Ginseng root is believed by some to be an aphrodisiac. The root is most often available in dried form, either whole or sliced. Ginseng leaf,although not as highly prized,is sometimes also used. As with the root it is most often available in dried form." iconUrl="images/items/20090630/Panax ginseng.png" price="60" heroItem="true"/>
  <itemEum id="hero.item.Tea" name="Tea" itemType="宝物" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="Recuperates hero's Strength by 10%." itemDesc="In many cultures, tea is often had at high class social events, such as?afternoon tea?and the?tea party. It may be consumed early in the day to heighten alertness. In ancient China, tea leaves were used as herbal medicine." iconUrl="images/items/20090630/Tea.png" price="10" heroItem="true"/>
  <itemEum id="hero.loyalty.1" name="Cross Medal" itemType="奖章" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="Increase a hero's Loyalty by 5 when rewarded. And it can be also used for hero Persuasion." itemDesc="Medal Reward is an important encouragement system. A country gives it as award to those who make outstanding contribution to the nation. Beside as award given to heroes, it can also used in the Persuasion of rival heroes." iconUrl="images/items/shizijiangzhang.png" price="0" heroItem="true"/>
  <itemEum id="hero.loyalty.2" name="Rose Medal" itemType="奖章" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="Increase a hero's Loyalty by 10 when rewarded. And it can be also used for hero Persuasion." itemDesc="Medal Reward is an important encouragement system. A country gives it as award to those who make outstanding contribution to the nation. Beside as award given to heroes, it can also used in the Persuasion of rival heroes." iconUrl="images/items/meiguijiangzhang.png" price="0" heroItem="true"/>
  <itemEum id="hero.loyalty.3" name="Lion Medal" itemType="奖章" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="Increase a hero's Loyalty by 15 when rewarded. And it is used for hero Persuasion." itemDesc="Medal Reward is an important encouragement system. A country gives it as award to those who make outstanding contribution to the nation. Beside as award given to heroes, it can also used in the Persuasion of rival heroes." iconUrl="images/items/jinshijiangzhang.png" price="0" heroItem="true"/>
