  <itemEum id="player.box.present.money.128" name="Lucky War Chest" itemType="宝箱" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="Includes: Gilded Shilelagh: (750 cents1 x Holy Helm of Mars1 x On War2x War Teleporter1x Masterwork of the Stone Mason1x Gundulf’s Compass.) Darby’s Fiddle Case: (1 x Holy Helm of Mars1 x Speech Text2 x Holy War 5 piece package2 x On War1x War Teleporter1x Gundulf’s Compass1 x Adv City Teleporter.) Leprechaun’s Bindle: (2 x Excalibur1 x On War1 x Speech Text1 x Masterwork of the Stonecutter1x Gundulf’s Compass2 x Random Medal1x Adv Teleporter.)  Chest of Rainbows: (1 x Masterwork of the Stonecutter2 x Adv City Teleporter 1 x City Teleporter1x War Teleporter1 x Wealth of Nations1 x Ultra Corselet.) Pot of Fortune: (2 x War Ensign 1 x Excalibur 1 x Adv City Teleporter 1x War Teleporter1 x War Horn3 x Aries Amulet.)" itemDesc="These chests are sent to you as St Patrick’s Day gifts from your friends in the game. They require an Emerald Key to open. You can obtain an Emerald Key for every $30 worth of purchases made during the St Patrick’s Day promotion. When opened, you will receive the contents of Lucky War Chest A, B,C,D or E at random." iconUrl="images/icon/shop/luckywarchest.png" price="0" playerItem="true"/>
