  <itemEum id="player.box.present.money.135" name="Easter Chest" itemType="宝箱" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="Opening this chest will grant you one of the following sets of items! Easter’s Big Haul(750 cents, 1 x Holy Helm of Mars, 3 x Angel/Devil Tokens, 1 x On War), Basket of Chocolates(1 x Holy Helm of Mars, 1 x Senior Medal Box, 2x Angel/Devil Tokens, 1 x On War, 1 x Ivory Horn,2 x Ultra Corselet, 1 x Adv City Teleporter), Box of Peeps(2 x Excalibur, 1x Angel/Devil Token, 2 x On War, 1 x Ivory Horn, 1x Medium Medal Box, 1x AdvTeleporter), Bag of Chocolate Coins(2 x Epitome of Military Science, 2 x Adv City Teleporter, 1x Junior Medal Box, 1 x Angel/Devil Token, 1 x Penicillin), Basket of Eggs(2 x War Ensign, 1 x Adv City Teleporter, 3 x Dynamite, 4 x Bernini’s Hammer, 1 x War Horn, 5 x Aries Amulet)" itemDesc="You have an Easter Basket from the 2013 Easter holiday! Open it and find out what goodies are inside!" iconUrl="images/icon/shop/easterchest2013.png" price="0" playerItem="true"/>
