  <itemEum id="player.box.present.money.168" name="Evoween Chest" itemType="宝箱" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="These chests are sent to you as Halloween gifts from your friends in the game. They require a Skeleton Key to open. You can obtain a Skeleton Key for every $30 worth of purchases made during this promotion. Opening this chest will grant you Evoween's  Chest A, B ,C,D, or E at random." itemDesc="These chests are sent to you as Halloween gifts from your friends in the game. They require a Skeleton Key to open. You can obtain a Skeleton Key for every $30 worth of purchases made during this promotion. Opening this chest will grant you Evoween's  Chest A, B ,C,D, or E at random." iconUrl="images/icon/shop/babayagaschest2013.png" price="0" playerItem="true"/>
