  <itemEum id="player.box.present.money.225" name="Gift of the Inferno" itemType="宝箱" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="It smells of the sickly sweet smell of death, soot and ozone. It seems to move on its own when you see it from the corner of your eye, and the bad itself it far too warm to the touch." itemDesc="When you open this package you will receive the following:1 x Adv Teleporter,1 x War Teleporter,3 x War Ensign,1 x Excalibur,1 x Corselet,1 x Stone of Finding" iconUrl="images/icon/shop/giftoftheinferno.png" price="0" playerItem="true"/>
  <itemEum id="player.box.present.money.226" name="The Malebolge Chest" itemType="宝箱" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="The gift of Malebolge, within you can faintly hear screaming and pleas for help. The chest emits an unnatural heat, and your troops refuse to stay near it when you are not around." itemDesc="Opening this chest will grant you a random set of chest items from the 2014 Evoween Promotion. When opened with a chest key you will receive one of the following:Chest A,Chest B,Chest C,Chest D,Chest E." iconUrl="images/icon/shop/themalebolgechest.png" price="0" playerItem="true"/>
