  <itemEum id="player.box.present.money.254" name="Jareth Gorn’s Trick Bag" itemType="宝箱" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="Legends of Jareth Gorn’s ability to trick the faery folk are many, and possibly overblown. However, he has recently gone missing once a bottomless bag was found, and linked to him. Throughout the kingdom more of these trick bags have been found, some holding useful treasures, and other holding nothing" itemDesc="Your free gift, included with $30 purchase. Includes:1 x Adv Teleporter,1 x War Teleporter,3 x War Ensign,1 x On War,1 x Stone of Finding,1 x Excalibur,1 x Corselet" iconUrl="images/icon/shop/jarethgornstrickbag.png" price="0" playerItem="true"/>
  <itemEum id="player.box.present.money.255" name="Iron Banded Faery Chest" itemType="宝箱" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="The forest faeries and other mythical denizens have left chests throughout the forests for the unwary and unsuspecting to find. Some have traps in them, others have a veritable bounty when opened, that changes depending on who is looking at it. What will you find?" itemDesc="Requires the Faery Ring Key to open, which is included with every $30 purchase. Contains a random assortment of items which could be worth more than 2500 cents!" iconUrl="images/icon/shop/ironbandedfaerychest.png" price="0" playerItem="true"/>
