  <itemEum id="player.box.present.money.314" name="The Raven’s Tribute" itemType="宝箱" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="And so the Elk and the Squirrel were merged. Within the night the Raven had prepared a tribute to celebrate. The skies darken as the crows and ravens of the land take to wing to play herald. As the calls echo through the hills, the bear comes from his slumber with a special firkin to tap." itemDesc="Your free gift, included with $30 purchase. Includes:1 x Adv Teleporter,1 x War Teleporter,3 x Stygandr’s Banner of the Horde,3 x War Ensign,1 x Stone of Finding,1 x Excalibur,1 x Corselet,1 x The Squirrel’s Key" iconUrl="images/icon/shop/theravenstribute.png" price="0" playerItem="true"/>
  <itemEum id="player.box.present.money.315" name="Crested Chest of the Elk" itemType="宝箱" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="As the celebration begins, this chest suddenly appears! Adorned with Elk antlers, and a small silver crest of a Squirrel surrounded by elk antlers, the chest is heavy with gifts." itemDesc="Requires the Squirrel’s Key to open, which is included with every $30 purchase. Contains a random assortment of items which could be worth more than 2500 cents!" iconUrl="images/icon/shop/crestedchestoftheelk.png" price="0" playerItem="true"/>
  <itemEum id="player.box.present.money.316" name="Offering of Thanks" itemType="宝箱" dayLimit="0" userLimit="0" desc="" itemDesc="" iconUrl="images/icon/shop/huangjingbaoxiang.png" price="0" playerItem="true"/>
